  "text": "This dark is on my side. Whatever's out there, I'll hear it first."
 },
 "gloom-m.normal.plane.water": {
  "file": "voice/gloom-m.normal.plane.water.mp3",
  "secs": 5.04,
  "text": "Deep water, and it drags. Stay where your feet can touch the bottom."
 },
 "gloom-m.normal.select": {
  "file": "voice/gloom-m.normal.select.mp3",
  "secs": 1.85,
  "text": "Fine. Let's get this over with."
 },
 "gloom-m.normal.start": {
  "file": "voice/gloom-m.normal.start.mp3",
  "secs": 8.23,
  "text": "It'll be long, it'll be hard, and it might go badly. I'm going anyway."
 },
 "gloom-m.tourist.biome.caverns": {
  "file": "voice/gloom-m.tourist.biome.caverns.mp3",
  "secs": 7.49,
  "text": "Glowing mushrooms. The brochure called them magical. They look like mouldy lamps."
 },
 "gloom-m.tourist.biome.chaos": {
  "file": "voice/gloom-m.tourist.biome.chaos.mp3",
  "secs": 7.34,
  "text": "Floating islands. Lovely. My flip-flop just fell off the edge. For ever."
 },
 "gloom-m.tourist.biome.crypt": {
  "file": "voice/gloom-m.tourist.biome.crypt.mp3",
  "secs": 8.08,
  "text": "This is the hotel? Cold, dark and full of bones. Honestly, better than I expected."
 },
 "gloom-m.tourist.biome.underdark": {
  "file": "voice/gloom-m.tourist.biome.underdark.mp3",
  "secs": 6.92,
  "text": "A room with a lava view. I asked for no view at all. Typical."
 },
 "gloom-m.tourist.infuse.air": {
  "file": "voice/gloom-m.tourist.infuse.air.mp3",
  "secs": 4.54,
  "text": "Faster? Oh, good. Now I can get to the end of this holiday sooner."
 },
 "gloom-m.tourist.infuse.earth": {
  "file": "voice/gloom-m.tourist.infuse.earth.mp3",
  "secs": 8.17,
  "text": "Stoneskin. Now I can lie on the beach like a rock. Which was my plan anyway."
 },
 "gloom-m.tourist.infuse.fire": {
  "file": "voice/gloom-m.tourist.infuse.fire.mp3",
  "secs": 5.41,
  "text": "Burning hands. Great. Now I can't even hold a cold drink."
 },
 "gloom-m.tourist.infuse.shadow": {
  "file": "voice/gloom-m.tourist.infuse.shadow.mp3",
  "secs": 7.15,
  "text": "Shadow. The first nice thing on this whole trip. I'll probably lose it."
 },
 "gloom-m.tourist.infuse.water": {
  "file": "voice/gloom-m.tourist.infuse.water.mp3",
  "secs": 5.97,
  "text": "Ice armour. At last, something on this holiday that's actually cool."
 },
 "gloom-m.tourist.plane.air": {
  "file": "voice/gloom-m.tourist.plane.air.mp3",
  "secs": 7.09,
  "text": "Wind. My board shorts are flapping like a flag. Nobody needs to see that."
 },
 "gloom-m.tourist.plane.earth": {
  "file": "voice/gloom-m.tourist.plane.earth.mp3",
  "secs": 6.69,
  "text": "Rocks falling on the guests. I said this place would be awful. Nobody listened."
 },
 "gloom-m.tourist.plane.fire": {
  "file": "voice/gloom-m.tourist.plane.fire.mp3",
  "secs": 7.95,
  "text": "Too hot, too bright, and not a scrap of shade. Worst beach ever."
 },
 "gloom-m.tourist.plane.light": {
  "file": "voice/gloom-m.tourist.plane.light.mp3",
  "secs": 9.2,
  "text": "Sunshine. All of it. Who would ever choose this for a holiday?"
 },
 "gloom-m.tourist.plane.shadow": {
  "file": "voice/gloom-m.tourist.plane.shadow.mp3",
  "secs": 4.85,
  "text": "Finally, some shade. Wake me when it's time to go home."
 },
 "gloom-m.tourist.plane.water": {
  "file": "voice/gloom-m.tourist.plane.water.mp3",
  "secs": 6.91,
  "text": "Swimming. Against my will. I'd like a word with whoever runs this sea."
 },
 "gloom-m.tourist.start": {
  "file": "voice/gloom-m.tourist.start.mp3",
  "secs": 9.66,
  "text": "I didn't want a holiday. Somebody packed my flip-flops anyway. Fine. Let's go."
 },
 "god.anvil.betrayed": {
  "file": "voice/god.anvil.betrayed.mp3",
  "secs": 7.04,
  "text": "Laying down my hammer, are you? Then mind the sparks. They'll follow you.",
  "who": "Old Anvil"
 },
 "god.anvil.browse": {
  "file": "voice/god.anvil.browse.mp3",
  "secs": 1.81,
  "text": "Good work. Good steel.",
  "who": "Old Anvil"
 },
 "god.anvil.pray.1": {
  "file": "voice/god.anvil.pray.1.mp3",
  "secs": 6.77,
  "text": "Sit by the fire a moment. There. Back to work.",
  "who": "Old Anvil"
 },
 "god.anvil.pray.2": {
  "file": "voice/god.anvil.pray.2.mp3",
  "secs": 5.35,
  "text": "The forge is warm again, and my favour with it. Off you go.",
  "who": "Old Anvil"
 },
 "god.anvil.rank.2": {
  "file": "voice/god.anvil.rank.2.mp3",
  "secs": 7.43,
  "text": "Your gear is getting stronger, and so are you. Here's a prayer from the old smith.",
  "who": "Old Anvil"
 },
 "god.anvil.rank.3": {
  "file": "voice/god.anvil.rank.3.mp3",
  "secs": 7.3,
  "text": "Well tempered. Heat, hammer and patience. You're learning.",
  "who": "Old Anvil"
 },
 "god.anvil.rank.4": {
  "file": "voice/god.anvil.rank.4.mp3",
  "secs": 6.1,
  "text": "Another prayer for you. Strike while the iron's hot.",
  "who": "Old Anvil"
 },
 "god.anvil.rank.5": {
  "file": "voice/god.anvil.rank.5.mp3",
  "secs": 8.93,
  "text": "Finest work I've seen in an age. Now go and light that Forge. It's been cold too long.",
  "who": "Old Anvil"
 },
 "god.anvil.swear": {
  "file": "voice/god.anvil.swear.mp3",
  "secs": 6.32,
  "text": "Welcome to the forge, young one. Good steel, good work, and I'll stand by you.",
  "who": "Old Anvil"
 },
 "god.chad.betrayed": {
  "file": "voice/god.chad.betrayed.mp3",
  "secs": 7.83,
  "text": "You'd leave Chad for another god? My heart aches. My fists do not. Beware.",
  "who": "Chad the Unclad"
 },
 "god.chad.browse": {
  "file": "voice/god.chad.browse.mp3",
  "secs": 1.36,
  "text": "Fists up, friend!",
  "who": "Chad the Unclad"
 },
 "god.chad.pray.1": {
  "file": "voice/god.chad.pray.1.mp3",
  "secs": 4.66,
  "text": "Chad's favour, back in your fists! Now back to the fight!",
  "who": "Chad the Unclad"
 },
 "god.chad.pray.2": {
  "file": "voice/god.chad.pray.2.mp3",
  "secs": 3.27,
  "text": "Favour restored! Fists up, champion!",
  "who": "Chad the Unclad"
 },
 "god.chad.rank.2": {
  "file": "voice/god.chad.rank.2.mp3",
  "secs": 5.56,
  "text": "Look at those knuckles! You've earned a prayer. Use it, and hit harder!",
  "who": "Chad the Unclad"
 },
 "god.chad.rank.3": {
  "file": "voice/god.chad.rank.3.mp3",
  "secs": 7.41,
  "text": "Every bare-handed blow makes you stronger. Chad sees it, and Chad is proud!",
  "who": "Chad the Unclad"
 },
 "god.chad.rank.4": {
  "file": "voice/god.chad.rank.4.mp3",
  "secs": 5.5,
  "text": "Another prayer for my champion! Nothing stands against honest fists!",
  "who": "Chad the Unclad"
 },
 "god.chad.rank.5": {
  "file": "voice/god.chad.rank.5.mp3",
  "secs": 6.7,
  "text": "The mightiest fists I have ever blessed! Go, and knock the Unmaker flat!",
  "who": "Chad the Unclad"
 },
 "god.chad.swear": {
  "file": "voice/god.chad.swear.mp3",
  "secs": 6.73,
  "text": "Welcome, friend! Drop the steel, trust your fists, and Chad will be with you every step!",
  "who": "Chad the Unclad"
 },
 "god.glimmer.betrayed": {
  "file": "voice/god.glimmer.betrayed.mp3",
  "secs": 6.58,
  "text": "You turn from the light? Then I cannot shield you from what follows. I am sorry.",
  "who": "Saint Glimmer"
 },
 "god.glimmer.browse": {
  "file": "voice/god.glimmer.browse.mp3",
  "secs": 2.04,
  "text": "Let my light guide you.",
  "who": "Saint Glimmer"
 },
 "god.glimmer.pray.1": {
  "file": "voice/god.glimmer.pray.1.mp3",
  "secs": 5.36,
  "text": "Rest a moment, little one. My favour is with you again.",
  "who": "Saint Glimmer"
 },
 "god.glimmer.pray.2": {
  "file": "voice/god.glimmer.pray.2.mp3",
  "secs": 6.72,
  "text": "The light returns to you. Go gently, and go bravely.",
  "who": "Saint Glimmer"
 },
 "god.glimmer.rank.2": {
  "file": "voice/god.glimmer.rank.2.mp3",
  "secs": 8.34,
  "text": "You have been brave and kind. Take this prayer, and let it heal you.",
  "who": "Saint Glimmer"
 },
 "god.glimmer.rank.3": {
  "file": "voice/god.glimmer.rank.3.mp3",
  "secs": 5.79,
  "text": "Your light grows brighter. The dead and the dark will feel it.",
  "who": "Saint Glimmer"
 },
 "god.glimmer.rank.4": {
  "file": "voice/god.glimmer.rank.4.mp3",
  "secs": 7.59,
  "text": "Another prayer, my dear. Keep it close for when the dark is deepest.",
  "who": "Saint Glimmer"
 },
 "god.glimmer.rank.5": {
  "file": "voice/god.glimmer.rank.5.mp3",
  "secs": 7.67,
  "text": "You shine like a sunrise now. Carry my light to the Forge, and let it burn again.",
  "who": "Saint Glimmer"
 },
 "god.glimmer.swear": {
  "file": "voice/god.glimmer.swear.mp3",
  "secs": 8.24,
  "text": "Welcome, little one. My light will mend you and guide you, all the way down.",
  "who": "Saint Glimmer"
 },
 "god.grumbok.betrayed": {
  "file": "voice/god.grumbok.betrayed.mp3",
  "secs": 8.05,
  "text": "You run to a spell-weaver's god? Coward. Grumbok will remember.",
  "who": "Grumbok, Who Hates Wizards"
 },
 "god.grumbok.browse": {
  "file": "voice/god.grumbok.browse.mp3",
  "secs": 2.46,
  "text": "Steel. No spells.",
  "who": "Grumbok, Who Hates Wizards"
 },
 "god.grumbok.pray.1": {
  "file": "voice/god.grumbok.pray.1.mp3",
  "secs": 5.1,
  "text": "Grumbok hears you. Get up. Fight.",
  "who": "Grumbok, Who Hates Wizards"
 },
 "god.grumbok.pray.2": {
  "file": "voice/god.grumbok.pray.2.mp3",
  "secs": 6.41,
  "text": "My favour is yours again. Spend it on your enemies.",
  "who": "Grumbok, Who Hates Wizards"
 },
 "god.grumbok.rank.2": {
  "file": "voice/god.grumbok.rank.2.mp3",
  "secs": 6.0,
  "text": "You fight with honest strength. Take my prayer, and fight harder.",
  "who": "Grumbok, Who Hates Wizards"
 },
 "god.grumbok.rank.3": {
  "file": "voice/god.grumbok.rank.3.mp3",
  "secs": 7.97,
  "text": "Every foe you strike down, Grumbok feels it. More.",
  "who": "Grumbok, Who Hates Wizards"
 },
 "god.grumbok.rank.4": {
  "file": "voice/god.grumbok.rank.4.mp3",
  "secs": 8.31,
  "text": "Strong. Stronger. Another prayer, warrior. The wizards will fear you.",
  "who": "Grumbok, Who Hates Wizards"
 },
 "god.grumbok.rank.5": {
  "file": "voice/god.grumbok.rank.5.mp3",
  "secs": 7.57,
  "text": "No wizard born could stand before you now. Go. End the Unmaker.",
  "who": "Grumbok, Who Hates Wizards"
 },
 "god.grumbok.swear": {
  "file": "voice/god.grumbok.swear.mp3",
  "secs": 9.33,
  "text": "No spells. No wands. No tricks. Just you, a weapon, and your enemies. Good.",
  "who": "Grumbok, Who Hates Wizards"
 },
 "god.murk.betrayed": {
  "file": "voice/god.murk.betrayed.mp3",
  "secs": 10.14,
  "text": "Leaving Mother? Oh, dearie. The dead never forget. Neither do I.",
  "who": "Mother Murk"
 },
 "god.murk.browse": {
  "file": "voice/god.murk.browse.mp3",
  "secs": 2.44,
  "text": "Come to Mother, dearie.",
  "who": "Mother Murk"
 },
 "god.murk.pray.1": {
  "file": "voice/god.murk.pray.1.mp3",
  "secs": 4.41,
  "text": "Hush, hush. Mother is here.",
  "who": "Mother Murk"
 },
 "god.murk.pray.2": {
  "file": "voice/god.murk.pray.2.mp3",
  "secs": 6.03,
  "text": "There, dearie. Mother's favour, all yours again.",
  "who": "Mother Murk"
 },
 "god.murk.rank.2": {
  "file": "voice/god.murk.rank.2.mp3",
  "secs": 7.38,
  "text": "Such a good child. Here's a prayer from Mother. The dead will answer it.",
  "who": "Mother Murk"
 },
 "god.murk.rank.3": {
  "file": "voice/god.murk.rank.3.mp3",
  "secs": 8.26,
  "text": "Every life you take feeds the quiet dark. Mother is pleased.",
  "who": "Mother Murk"
 },
 "god.murk.rank.4": {
  "file": "voice/god.murk.rank.4.mp3",
  "secs": 8.08,
  "text": "Another gift, my darling. Call the dead, and they will come.",
  "who": "Mother Murk"
 },
 "god.murk.rank.5": {
  "file": "voice/god.murk.rank.5.mp3",
  "secs": 8.3,
  "text": "My finest child. Not even the Unmaker can unmake what Mother keeps.",
  "who": "Mother Murk"
 },
 "god.murk.swear": {
  "file": "voice/god.murk.swear.mp3",
  "secs": 9.75,
  "text": "Come here, dearie. Mother Murk will keep you, and the dead will walk beside you.",
  "who": "Mother Murk"
 },
 "god.reginald.betrayed": {
  "file": "voice/god.reginald.betrayed.mp3",
  "secs": 6.82,
  "text": "You abandon honour? For shame! My wrath shall find you. Openly, of course.",
  "who": "Sir Reginald the Unsneaky"
 },
 "god.reginald.browse": {
  "file": "voice/god.reginald.browse.mp3",
  "secs": 1.28,
  "text": "Face them fairly!",
  "who": "Sir Reginald the Unsneaky"
 },
 "god.reginald.pray.1": {
  "file": "voice/god.reginald.pray.1.mp3",
  "secs": 4.37,
  "text": "Chin up, champion! My favour rides with you once more!",
  "who": "Sir Reginald the Unsneaky"
 },
 "god.reginald.pray.2": {
  "file": "voice/god.reginald.pray.2.mp3",
  "secs": 4.11,
  "text": "On your feet! A true knight never stays down.",
  "who": "Sir Reginald the Unsneaky"
 },
 "god.reginald.rank.2": {
  "file": "voice/god.reginald.rank.2.mp3",
  "secs": 6.26,
  "text": "You let them see you coming, and you beat them anyway. A prayer, for your honour!",
  "who": "Sir Reginald the Unsneaky"
 },
 "god.reginald.rank.3": {
  "file": "voice/god.reginald.rank.3.mp3",
  "secs": 6.47,
  "text": "Fair and square, every single time! I am very nearly proud of you.",
  "who": "Sir Reginald the Unsneaky"
 },
 "god.reginald.rank.4": {
  "file": "voice/god.reginald.rank.4.mp3",
  "secs": 5.84,
  "text": "Another prayer, my brave knight! Charge, and let them hear you coming!",
  "who": "Sir Reginald the Unsneaky"
 },
 "god.reginald.rank.5": {
  "file": "voice/god.reginald.rank.5.mp3",
  "secs": 9.02,
  "text": "The bravest, fairest fighter I have ever known. Go, and face the Unmaker head-on!",
  "who": "Sir Reginald the Unsneaky"
 },
 "god.reginald.swear": {
  "file": "voice/god.reginald.swear.mp3",
  "secs": 8.07,
  "text": "Splendid! From this day, you fight in the open, face to face, as a true champion should!",
  "who": "Sir Reginald the Unsneaky"
 },
 "god.sylla.betrayed": {
  "file": "voice/god.sylla.betrayed.mp3",
  "secs": 9.25,
  "text": "You slip from my web? I can wait. I always wait.",
  "who": "Sylla the Patient"
 },
 "god.sylla.browse": {
  "file": "voice/god.sylla.browse.mp3",
  "secs": 1.13,
  "text": "Wait for it, sweet.",
  "who": "Sylla the Patient"
 },
 "god.sylla.pray.1": {
  "file": "voice/god.sylla.pray.1.mp3",
  "secs": 4.23,
  "text": "Hush. Rest in the web a while.",
  "who": "Sylla the Patient"
 },
 "god.sylla.pray.2": {
  "file": "voice/god.sylla.pray.2.mp3",
  "secs": 3.75,
  "text": "My favour, wrapped around you like silk.",
  "who": "Sylla the Patient"
 },
 "god.sylla.rank.2": {
  "file": "voice/god.sylla.rank.2.mp3",
  "secs": 6.58,
  "text": "Patience, rewarded. Take this prayer, and let the brood come to you.",
  "who": "Sylla the Patient"
 },
 "god.sylla.rank.3": {
  "file": "voice/god.sylla.rank.3.mp3",
  "secs": 7.24,
  "text": "Every web you weave, every sting you land. Sylla feels them all.",
  "who": "Sylla the Patient"
 },
 "god.sylla.rank.4": {
  "file": "voice/god.sylla.rank.4.mp3",
  "secs": 5.86,
  "text": "Another prayer, my clever one. Let the poison do its work.",
  "who": "Sylla the Patient"
 },
 "god.sylla.rank.5": {
  "file": "voice/god.sylla.rank.5.mp3",
  "secs": 7.16,
  "text": "No hunter has ever waited so well. The Unmaker will never see you coming.",
  "who": "Sylla the Patient"
 },
 "god.sylla.swear": {
  "file": "voice/god.sylla.swear.mp3",
  "secs": 7.27,
  "text": "Be still, my sweet. Wait in the dark, and strike when they least expect it.",
  "who": "Sylla the Patient"
 },
 "god.vellum.betrayed": {
  "file": "voice/god.vellum.betrayed.mp3",
  "secs": 7.22,
  "text": "You close the book on me? Very well. I have noted it. In ink.",
  "who": "Vellum, the Open Book"
 },
 "god.vellum.browse": {
  "file": "voice/god.vellum.browse.mp3",
  "secs": 1.76,
  "text": "Every spell, waiting.",
  "who": "Vellum, the Open Book"
 },
 "god.vellum.pray.1": {
  "file": "voice/god.vellum.pray.1.mp3",
  "secs": 4.73,
  "text": "Breathe. Focus. My favour is yours again.",
  "who": "Vellum, the Open Book"
 },
 "god.vellum.pray.2": {
  "file": "voice/god.vellum.pray.2.mp3",
  "secs": 2.29,
  "text": "A fresh page. Use it well.",
  "who": "Vellum, the Open Book"
 },
 "god.vellum.rank.2": {
  "file": "voice/god.vellum.rank.2.mp3",
  "secs": 5.96,
  "text": "A fine start. A new prayer is written in you now. Use it wisely.",
  "who": "Vellum, the Open Book"
 },
 "god.vellum.rank.3": {
  "file": "voice/god.vellum.rank.3.mp3",
  "secs": 4.6,
  "text": "Your spells grow sharper. I am adding a new page.",
  "who": "Vellum, the Open Book"
 },
 "god.vellum.rank.4": {
  "file": "voice/god.vellum.rank.4.mp3",
  "secs": 4.62,
  "text": "Another prayer, well earned. Study it closely.",
  "who": "Vellum, the Open Book"
 },
 "god.vellum.rank.5": {
  "file": "voice/god.vellum.rank.5.mp3",
  "secs": 8.84,
  "text": "You have mastered more than most will ever read. Go, and write the Unmaker's final chapter.",
  "who": "Vellum, the Open Book"
 },
 "god.vellum.swear": {
  "file": "voice/god.vellum.swear.mp3",
  "secs": 6.37,
  "text": "Every spell ever spoken is written in me. Read well, and I will open to you.",
  "who": "Vellum, the Open Book"
 },
 "god.wobbles.betrayed": {
  "file": "voice/god.wobbles.betrayed.mp3",
  "secs": 7.69,
  "text": "You're leaving? Oh, that's not funny. Not funny at all. Wait for it.",
  "who": "Wobbles, the Giggling Chaos"
 },
 "god.wobbles.browse": {
  "file": "voice/god.wobbles.browse.mp3",
  "secs": 0.94,
  "text": "Pick me!",
  "who": "Wobbles, the Giggling Chaos"
 },
 "god.wobbles.gift.1": {
  "file": "voice/god.wobbles.gift.1.mp3",
  "secs": 2.18,
  "text": "A present, just for you!",
  "who": "Wobbles, the Giggling Chaos"
 },
 "god.wobbles.gift.2": {
  "file": "voice/god.wobbles.gift.2.mp3",
  "secs": 2.3,
  "text": "Surprise! It's a good one!",
  "who": "Wobbles, the Giggling Chaos"
 },
 "god.wobbles.laugh.1": {
  "file": "voice/god.wobbles.laugh.1.mp3",
  "secs": 0.97,
  "text": "Heh heh!",
  "who": "Wobbles, the Giggling Chaos"
 },
 "god.wobbles.laugh.2": {
  "file": "voice/god.wobbles.laugh.2.mp3",
  "secs": 1.12,
  "text": "Hee hee!",
  "who": "Wobbles, the Giggling Chaos"
 },
 "god.wobbles.laugh.3": {
  "file": "voice/god.wobbles.laugh.3.mp3",
